{
  "name": "mastercard-cis-template",
  "description": "STRUCTURAL TEMPLATE ONLY. Encodings follow publicly described Customer Interface Specification conventions (EBCDIC text and numerics, binary bitmap, EBCDIC length prefixes). Field definitions and framing MUST be replaced with the ones in your licensed Mastercard specification and proven in Mastercard testing before use. The platform refuses to load template dialects in production.",
